  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pad pak ruam serves 2 and takes about 12 minutes. It is a simple everyday stir-fry where the vegetables cook quickly in a very hot wok with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "garlic",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "garlic"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "oyster sauce",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "oyster-sauce"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The mix here uses beansprouts and spring onions alongside tofu. Use whatever vegetables you have to hand."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cut all the vegetables to a similar size so they cook in the same time. Larger pieces can go in first, giving smaller or more delicate items 30 seconds less in the wok."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
